cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "One object instead of a choice of vacuum to put the observer in de
  Sitter space: From wormholes, black holes and baby universes to the criteria
  for an observer in de Sitter, contrasted with the Kaluza–Klein graviton
  candidates and with the cosmological constant"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
authors:
  - family-names: González García
    given-names: Jorge Armando
